{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12393","headline":"夕游覆釜山道士观因登玄元庙 · 钱起","name":"夕游覆釜山道士观因登玄元庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冥搜过物表，洞府次溪傍。\n已入瀛洲远，谁言仙路长。\n孤烟出深竹，道侣正焚香。\n鸣磬爱山静，步虚宜夜凉。\n仍同象帝庙，更上紫霞冈。\n霁月悬琪树，明星映碧堂。\n倾思丹竈术，愿采玉芝芳。\n傥把浮丘袂，乘云别旧乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}